WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.567
-Well, guys,
I've always said that

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.868
the best advice comes from kids.

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.033
So with that in mind,
it's time for "Kid Advice."

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:06.033
Here we go.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.601
-♪ "Kid Advice" ♪

00:00:08.601 --> 00:00:10.434
♪ Advice ♪

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:11.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.234
-But, first, I'm gonna need
someone to help me.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:15.534
His children's book,

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:18.000
"The One and Only Sparkella
Makes a Plan,"

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.434
is out May 31st.

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:22.100
Please welcome Channing Tatum,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:26.434
Yeah! That's my man. Hey!

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:28.067
Good to see you, buddy.

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.200
Channing.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.567
-Yes, sir.

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:33.267
-Channing, we asked our
viewers at home to send in

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:34.968
some advice that their kids had.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.400
We got so many
amazing responses,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.501
and I thought that
maybe we could read

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:38.767
some of our favorites right now.

00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:40.968
Does that sound okay to you?
-Please. Absolutely.

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:42.000
-Alright, here we go.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.501
I will start.
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.501
[ Lullaby playing ]

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:55.968
That's true.
Channing, your turn.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.267
-That's actually good advice.
3 years old.

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:10.968
How about this one?

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:37.734
-Wow.

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:42.868
That's a long one.
Alright, this one's good.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:49.801
That's fantastic.

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.667
-I'm down with Sophie.

00:01:58.434 --> 00:02:01.033
-That's actually --
This is great advice.

00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:02.100
How about this one?

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:18.400
Our final one -- You want to
bring us home, Channing?

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.000
Give us the
final piece of advice.

00:02:25.601 --> 00:02:27.701
"Inhale. Outhale."

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:29.000
Thank you to all our kids.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.868
Thank you to Channing Tatum!
My man!

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:32.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:34.033
His new children's book,

00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:36.701
"The One and Only Sparkella
Makes a Plan,"

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:38.267
is available May 31st.

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:39.567
Thank you for doing that,
Channing.

00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:41.968
I appreciate it, buddy.
-Thank you, guys.

